---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Studies" sideBarActiveItemID="studies">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Current Studies at KTH</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    The BSc in Information & Communication Technology at KTH Royal Institute of
    Technology covers a wide range of computing and mathematics theory and we
    can choose from many optional courses, so I am providing a detailed
    breakdown of the courses I have completed here to show my areas of
    expertise. I have already completed most of the technical courses, and have
    mainly pure mathematics courses to complete (I'm much better at the
    practical application of mathematics than pure theory 😅) and my final
    thesis project.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Completed Courses</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
